{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31332","headline":"寄华州周侍郎立秋日奉诏祭岳诗 · 李景让","name":"寄华州周侍郎立秋日奉诏祭岳诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关河豁静晓云开，承诏秋祠太守来。\n山霁莲花添翠黛，路阴桐叶少尘埃。\n朱轓入庙威仪肃，玉佩昇坛步武回。\n往岁今朝几时事，谢君非重我非才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李景让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}